    "Stay in the golden hour with me\nWhere every light is soft and slow\nHold on, the sky is burning gently\nDon't let it go, don't let it go": {
      "comment": "Demo song lyrics",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quédate conmigo en la hora dorada\nDonde la luz es suave y lenta\nNo te sueltes, el cielo arde despacio\nNo lo dejes ir, no lo dejes ir"
          }
        }
